      <title>One dead and another missing in suspected grizzly bear attack in Canada</title>
      <link>https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/03/grizzly-bear-attack-canada</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The incident took place in the same province where a grizzly attacked a group of schoolchildren last November&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A mother is dead and her daughter is missing in western Canada after a suspected grizzly bear attack in the same community where a bear &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/world/2025/nov/24/canada-grizzly-bear-attack-search"&gt;attacked a group of schoolchildren&lt;/a&gt; earlier in the year.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On Tuesday, the British Columbia conservation officer service said in a social media post that it had launched a search for the two missing people on the weekend, and that during the search on Sunday an officer found the mother’s body. The search for her 19-year-old daughter is ongoing.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/03/grizzly-bear-attack-canada"&gt;Continue reading...&lt;/a&gt;</description>
